        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-28T20:20:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've never heard of NaGaDeMon, but it sounds like basically the gaming equivalent of NaNoWriMo (something-something-Writing-Month, I think). I don't think I could come up with a whole game by myself - I'm fine for fluff. I can make up stories easily and will jump at a chance to do so. But coming up with and handling mechanics is something I'd rather leave other people to do ;).</p>",
